<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blaine: Ayo, you!\rMy Block on Cinnabar Island got burned\ndown by the volcano!\rBut I ain’t givin’ up! Look at\nthis cave.\rWe turned it into a Block, and I’m\nstill out here bein’ a Block Boss!\rI’ll give you the Block Chain if you\nbeat me!\rYou ready? Let’s go!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blaine: Awesome. I’m burnt out...\fTake this Volcano Chain!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got\nthe Volcano Chain from Blaine!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blaine: Here, I’ll give you this too.\nIt’s called Overcook!\rIt got a lil drawback, but it’s\npowerful and worth it!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blaine: I lost this time, but I’m\ngon’ win next time.\rWhen I rebuild my Cinnabar Block,\nwe gotta have a rematch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blaine: My Fire-type homies gon’ be\neven stronger! Just watch!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh, a Block in a CAVE? Blaine built\nthis with his bare hands. And a lotta\fduct tape.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The pain of losin’ make you better\ntomorrow. I’m VERY good tomorrow.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The pain of losin’ make you better\ntomorrow. I’m VERY good tomorrow.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m collectin’ battle records for\nscience. Lab coat and everythin’.\rHelp me out? By losin’?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I ain’t expect you to be THIS good!\nWho ARE you? Put that in the records!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I ain’t expect you to be THIS good!\nWho ARE you? Put that in the records!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ooh! You look EASY to beat!\nNo offense!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad! I ain’t sense how strong you.\nMy senses is off. It’s the volcano gas.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My bad! I ain’t sense how strong you.\nMy senses is off. It’s the volcano gas.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lab coat life is the researcher life.\nWe might live in a cave, but we\fnever forget to do the laundry.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This white lab coat make me feel\nsmarter for some reason.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This white lab coat make me feel\nsmarter for some reason.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Blaine lost his Block, but he NEVER give\nup. He rebuilt it in a CAVE. With a\fhammer. And a dream.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Together with Blaine, we gon’ rebuild\nour Block!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Together with Blaine, we gon’ rebuild\nour Block!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We lost the Block on Cinnabar and felt\nlost... Then Blaine said “cave.”\fWe ain’t argue.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We take the L when we lose...\rAin’t we honest?\rDon’t EVER lump us in with the Cooks\nwho work for The Feds. We LEGIT.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We take the L when we lose...\rAin’t we honest?\rDon’t EVER lump us in with the Cooks\nwho work for The Feds. We LEGIT.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo! Future legend!\rThis Block got MAD Hustlers and rocks\nin the way from the rebuild.\fIt ain’t easy to reach Blaine!\rBut keep your cool and beat the\nHustlers one by one. Bring a fan. It’s\fHOT.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0053_D11R0106_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Block Boss rebuildin’ his Block,\nand the Johto Hustler who came\fto challenge him...\rI just witnessed a HOT scrap!</language>
	</row>
</body>
